  "description": "Despite belonging to a family of esteemed knights, Felice has talent for magic and becomes the youngest imperial archmage in history. But his brilliance leaves someone in the shadows: Aeris, the heir to a renowned family of mages who was expected to become the next archmage. Driven by a bitter inferiority complex, Aeris casts a dark curse on himself. When Felice arrives to save his childhood friend, he discovers that he can only lift the curse by sleeping with him. In this twisted game of lust and obsession, can Felice heal the heart he inadvertently broke?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
